1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:02,701
Every ship ever built

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:05,048
has the same weakness.

3
00:00:05,192 --> 00:00:07,185
It can be seen.

4
00:00:07,356 --> 00:00:09,499
Light leaves the sun,

5
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:11,412
strikes the hull,

6
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:13,921
and travels to your eye.

7
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:17,092
Break that path. The ship is gone.

8
00:00:17,452 --> 00:00:19,881
We've hidden ships before.

9
00:00:19,904 --> 00:00:23,678
By 1940, hulls were wrapped in cable,

10
00:00:23,798 --> 00:00:26,861
to cancel their magnetic field.

11
00:00:26,971 --> 00:00:30,013
Magnetic mines couldn't find them.

12
00:00:30,433 --> 00:00:33,699
Hull 7 asks the next question.

13
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:36,568
Can coils hide a ship from light?

14
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:39,409
Light already bends.

15
00:00:39,519 --> 00:00:42,457
Over a hot road, layered air

16
00:00:42,548 --> 00:00:45,722
bends the sky down to your eye.

17
00:00:45,865 --> 00:00:47,798
That's a mirage.

18
00:00:48,317 --> 00:00:51,437
Now wrap that layer around a hull.

19
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:54,193
Light from the sea behind it

20
00:00:54,231 --> 00:00:56,406
curves around the hull,

21
00:00:56,538 --> 00:00:59,222
and reaches you. No ship.

22
00:00:59,567 --> 00:01:01,840
46 coil bands.

23
00:01:01,875 --> 00:01:05,266
One every 2 m, bow to stern.

24
00:01:05,337 --> 00:01:08,154
93 m of hull.

25
00:01:08,221 --> 00:01:10,710
Power: four generators,

26
00:01:10,817 --> 00:01:13,917
1.2 MW each.

27
00:01:14,279 --> 00:01:17,432
Trial one. 500 m.

28
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:19,252
Not seen.

29
00:01:19,327 --> 00:01:21,182
2 km.

30
00:01:21,202 --> 00:01:23,002
Not seen.

31
00:01:23,077 --> 00:01:24,994
8 km.

32
00:01:25,096 --> 00:01:26,896
Not seen.

33
00:01:28,413 --> 00:01:30,629
One side effect.

34
00:01:30,721 --> 00:01:33,190
Within 200 m,

35
00:01:33,317 --> 00:01:35,949
compasses can't be trusted.

36
00:01:36,635 --> 00:01:40,006
Hull 7 is cleared for sea trials.

37
00:01:40,673 --> 00:01:42,913
So. Can it be seen?

38
00:01:43,269 --> 00:01:45,184
Not anymore.
